is a voluntary agreement most search-engines (including YaCy) follow.==是一个大多数搜索引擎(包括YaCy)都遵守的协议.
It disallows crawlers to access webpages or even entire domains.==它会阻止网络爬虫进入网页甚至是整个域.
Deny access to==禁止访问
